# Build-time override of the Antigravity proxy URL.
# Leave unset for local dev (defaults to http://localhost:3000).
# For the Vercel build, set this to your Railway proxy URL, e.g.:
#   VITE_PROXY_URL=https://your-proxy.up.railway.app
# (You can also change it at runtime with ?proxy=<url> in the web app URL.)
VITE_PROXY_URL=
